Node REPL = Read Eval Print Loop

Is an environment where user inputs are read and evaluated, and then the results are returned to the user.

To start using Node
 1. Type in terminal  node

.help is for getting comands

.exit

Control+ C to force exit

How to run js file in terminal with node?

Node file_name.js



